-| [artifact.certify](./artifact-certify.md) | Certify a Forge NormalizedVizSpec IR (the same IR viz.render emits as normalizedSpec), optionally with the chart's DATA. Returns a per-pillar verdict summary (pillars:{a11yEquivalence,determinism,contrast,accuracy} — five-valued on contrast, four-valued on accuracy) that disaggregates what was actually checked, plus — on the cartesian path — a folded conformance gate. Read-only: it reads the IR and the operand, never rebuilds or re-recommends.
+| [artifact.certify](./artifact-certify.md) | Certify the Forge NormalizedVizSpec returned by viz.render. Returns coverage, a measured conformant result, findings, and four pillars: a11yEquivalence, determinism, contrast and accuracy. Read-only: it reads the IR and the matching data operand without rebuilding or recommending a chart.
 
